td\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePlain-language explanation\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eChecklist and JSON\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSimple explanation in user's language\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e6\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eVoice layer\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSpoken question\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGrounded spoken answer\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e7\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput and handoff\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eAll results\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCard view, PDF / WhatsApp-ready share, reminders\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e"},{"block_id":"p2-b4","coordinates":{"x1":252,"y1":1481,"x2":965,"y2":1560},"bbox_norm":[0.10157194679564692,0.4221778791334094,0.3889560661023781,0.44469783352337516],"layout_tag":"section-title","confidence":0.833,"reading_order":4,"text":"5. Stage-by-stage detail"},{"block_id":"p2-b5","coordinates":{"x1":235,"y1":1578,"x2":2240,"y2":2054},"bbox_norm":[0.0947198710197501,0.44982896237172176,0.9028617492946392,0.5855188141391106],"layout_tag":"table","confidence":0.9443,"reading_order":5,"text":"\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSTAGE 1\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWhat happens\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eThe user uploads a photo or PDF, or forwards one from the phone. They choose a language, or the system detects it from their first voice question. A quality check warns about blur, glare or cut-off edges and asks for a retake.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTech used\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWeb app (mobile first), image preprocessing (rotate, deskew, contrast).\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eA clean document image tied to a session ID.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e"},{"block_id":"p2-b6","coordinates":{"x1":235,"y1":2094,"x2":2240,"y2":2562},"bbox_norm":[0.0947198710197501,0.5969213226909921,0.9028617492946392,0.7303306727480046],"layout_tag":"table","confidence":0.9351,"reading_order":6,"text":"\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSTAGE 2\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDocument reading\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWhat happens\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eExtracts text, tables, stamps and layout from the scan. Handles low-quality phone photos and pages that mix English with a regional language. Keeps page and region references for later highlighting.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTech used\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSarvam Vision (document intelligence).\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eClean text plus coordinates for each block.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e"},{"block_id":"p2-b7","coordinates":{"x1":234,"y1":2606,"x2":2238,"y2":3132},"bbox_norm":[0.094316807738815,0.7428734321550741,0.9020556227327691,0.8928164196123147],"layout_tag":"table","confidence":0.957,"reading_order":7,"text":"\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSTAGE 3\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eClassification and extraction\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWhat happens\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eIdentifies the document type (tax notice, scheme application, bank KYC letter, legal notice, utility bill, etc.) and fills a fixed schema. Each field carries a confidence level and the source snippet it came from.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTech used\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSarvam chat model with a strict JSON schema prompt, plus code-based validation (regex for dates, amounts, IDs).\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eStructured JSON (see schema in section 6).\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e"},{"block_id":"p2-b8","coordinates":{"x1":228,"y1":3354,"x2":919,"y2":3402},"bbox_norm":[0.09189842805320435,0.9561